      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I don't understand your question, panda. Note that customizing tooltip color has been a common functionality used in custom maps in Blizzard games, Minecraft and more, so I think it's ok from an accessibility perspective.\nOr are you concerned about the performance overhead in having rich text enabled in the help tooltips? Given that only one is visible on a given frame, I doubt this performance overhead is a concern.",
